{
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "title": "Churn API - Monitoring",
  "uid": "churn-monitoring",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📊 Evidently Drift Detection",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "🚨 Evidently Drift",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "evidently_drift_detected",
          "legendFormat": "Drift"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "✅ No Drift",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "⚠️ Drift Detected",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Drift Share %",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "evidently_drift_share * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Drift %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 25
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drifted Features",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "evidently_drifted_features_count",
          "legendFormat": "Count"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Online Accuracy",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "model_accuracy",
          "legendFormat": "Accuracy"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Current p95 Latency",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(prediction_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "🔬 Alibi Detect - Statistical Tests (KS / Chi²)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "🧪 Alibi Drift Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_drift_detected",
          "legendFormat": "Drift"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "✅ No Drift",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "⚠️ KS/Chi² Drift",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "📊 Numerical Drift",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_numerical_drift_detected",
          "legendFormat": "Numerical"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "✅ OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "⚠️ KS Drift",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "📊 Categorical Drift",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_categorical_drift_detected",
          "legendFormat": "Categorical"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "✅ OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "⚠️ Chi² Drift",
                  "color": "orange"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "🔢 Alibi Drifted Features",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_drifted_features_count",
          "legendFormat": "Count"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "P-Value Threshold",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_p_value_threshold",
          "legendFormat": "Threshold"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.1,
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "📅 Report Age",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_report_age_seconds / 3600",
          "legendFormat": "Hours"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 24
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 72
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "📊 Feature P-Values (Alibi KS/Chi²)",
      "description": "P-values from Kolmogorov-Smirnov test (numerical) and Chi-Square test (categorical). Values below threshold (0.05) indicate drift.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_feature_pvalue",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature}} ({{dtype}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 4,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "🔍 Feature Drift Status (Alibi)",
      "description": "Shows which features have drift detected based on p-value < 0.05",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "alibi_feature_drift",
          "legendFormat": "{{feature}}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "✅ OK",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "⚠️ DRIFT",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "feature"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📈 API Performance",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "📈 Prediction Latency (p95)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(prediction_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(prediction_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "📊 Throughput (req/s)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(prediction_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "❌ Error Rate (%)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(prediction_errors_total[5m])) / sum(rate(prediction_requests_total[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "error%"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "📈 Drift Comparison Over Time",
      "description": "Compare Evidently and Alibi drift detection over time",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "evidently_drift_share * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Evidently Drift %"
        },
        {
          "expr": "alibi_drift_detected * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Alibi Drift (0/100)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "📄 Monitoring Reports & API",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 📊 Access Detailed Reports\n\n| Tool | Report Type | Link |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| **Evidently** | HTML Reports | [http://localhost:8888](http://localhost:8888) |\n| **Evidently** | API Status | [/monitoring/evidently/status](http://localhost:8000/monitoring/evidently/status) |\n| **Alibi** | API Status | [/monitoring/alibi/status](http://localhost:8000/monitoring/alibi/status) |\n\n> **Drift Detection Methods**:\n> - **Evidently**: Uses distribution comparison with statistical tests\n> - **Alibi Detect**: Uses **Kolmogorov-Smirnov** test for numerical features and **Chi-Square** test for categorical features (p-value threshold: 0.05)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Drift Alerts",
        "enable": true,
        "datasource": "Prometheus",
        "expr": "changes(evidently_drift_detected[1m]) > 0 or changes(alibi_drift_detected[1m]) > 0",
        "tagKeys": "alertname",
        "titleFormat": "Drift Status Changed"
      }
    ]
  }
}